  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting vulnerable smallholder farming communities affected by the current economic and food security crisis in Sri Lanka through improving their production capacities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the production capacity of the most vulnerable smallholder paddy farmers in identified districts in the Intermediate and Dry Zone by providing Urea for 2023 Yala and/or 2023-24 Maha cropping season enabling 76,000 smallholder paddy farmers cultivating paddy on land holdings up to 1 Ha</narrative>
  </description>
